  - m_Id: 3010518569705472
    m_Localized: Fruit surrenders to smoothness in seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259904
    m_Localized: A fruity whirlwind. Lid strongly recommended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259905
    m_Localized: The slice of life, only faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259906
    m_Localized: Strawberries sliced mid-thought. Kiwis tremble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259907
    m_Localized: Morning motivation, brewed even faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259908
    m_Localized: Brews so fast, customers wake up before they sip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259909
    m_Localized: Bakes golden happiness in no time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259910
    m_Localized: Cupcakes rise to the occasion at lightning speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259911
    m_Localized: Dough turns pan-tastic a lot sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010518603259912
    m_Localized: Donuts fry at chaotic speed. Pure pan-demonium!
