  - m_Id: 8069150969683968
    m_Localized: Fruit goes in, a smoothie storm comes out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151074541568
    m_Localized: Smoothie Hurricane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151074541569
    m_Localized: Blends so fast it bends time. Brain freeze included.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151074541570
    m_Localized: Galaxy Blender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151074541571
    m_Localized: Kiwis are sliced before they can roll away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151074541572
    m_Localized: Samurai Fruit Board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151078735872
    m_Localized: One swing, a whole fruit salad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151078735873
    m_Localized: Legendary Fruit Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151078735874
    m_Localized: Coffee at jet speed. Hold on to your mug.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151091318784
    m_Localized: Espresso Jet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069151091318785
    m_Localized: Brews a perfect cup before you finish blinking.
    m_Metadata:
